  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parntership in Statistics in BiH (phase 3) SCB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Parntership in Statistics in BiH (phase 3) SCB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att forts&#xe4;tta st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att utveckla prioriterade    statistik f&#xf6;r att bygga statistiska och institutionell kapacitet i de tre statistiska officerare och g&#xf6;ra statistik motsvarar nationella    behov och EU: s och internationella regler och normer i statistiken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to continue the support to develop           prioritized statistics, to build statistical and institutional        capacity in the three statistical officers and to make statistics     correspond to national needs and EU and international regulations and standards in statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
